  "description": "Strongly typed C# OpenSTAAD wrapper for Bentley STAAD.Pro automation on Windows .NET 9 (.NET Core). Provides session attachment/acquisition with process and model identity checks, cached native version and input-unit queries, main-window metadata and live model/path/process observations with XML IntelliSense. This preview implements the wrapper foundation and ten Root observations; other domain operations remain pending. Requires installed, licensed STAAD.Pro.",
