  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Ported five live Root observations: GetStaadFileFullPath, GetStaadFileFolder, IsPhysicalModel, GetErrorMessage and GetProcessId. Preserved native text and blank/unwritten distinctions, validated classification and process identifiers, and shared constructing-thread, stale-binding, disposal and reentrancy guards. Included complete matching XML IntelliSense, examples and package-consumer checks. Ten common Root contracts are now available; other domain operations remain pending.",
